### Valid PUT
PUT http://localhost:5194/tickets/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Updated billing issue",
  "category": "Billing",
  "isClosed": true
}

### Verify route id wins
GET http://localhost:5194/tickets/2

### Missing ticket
PUT http://localhost:5194/tickets/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Missing",
  "category": "Other",
  "isClosed": false
}

