### Close existing ticket
PATCH http://localhost:5194/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isClosed": true
}

### Verify
GET http://localhost:5194/tickets/1

### Reopen it
PATCH http://localhost:5194/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isClosed": false
}

### Missing ticket
PATCH http://localhost:5194/tickets/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isClosed": true
}









### Delete existing ticket
DELETE http://localhost:5194/tickets/4

### Delete same ticket again
DELETE http://localhost:5194/tickets/4

### Check remaining tickets
GET http://localhost:5194/tickets


















